  "implementation": [
    "VM Program Fanout ingress validates original parent/worker Source and dynamic controls before moving the collection.",
    "The actual parent frame retains free captures; earlier workers receive checked unrestricted copies and the last worker takes the original. Future item slots are owned once.",
    "Indexed original Program workers use ordinary task admission, child fibers, local Ready storage and the common aggregate preparation before result binding.",
    "Suspended Program state has inert-only Clone/Serde. VM and compiled-region suspension exits contain metadata only; live values remain in the actual fiber.",
    "Existing HostCall/Await/parity consumers inspect the original fiber rather than a copied suspension. Parity still observes the original suspended values."
  ],
